flowchart LR
  Y[Committed Response] --> IEC[IEC]
  IEC --> O[Objective Checks]
  IEC --> G[Grounded Evidence Checks]
  IEC --> S[Semantic Verifiers]
  IEC --> M[Metamorphic Checks]
  O --> A[Aggregate]
  G --> A
  S --> A
  M --> A
  A --> L[LCB + Disagreement]
  L -->|pass| ACC[ACCEPT]
  L -->|uncertain| ABS[ABSTAIN]
  L -->|fail| REJ[REJECT]
